@page "/"

<PageTitle>MES Decision Support</PageTitle>

<div class="container py-5">
	<h1>MES Decision Support</h1>

	<p class="lead">
		A research-driven Manufacturing Execution System
		with AI-assisted decision support.
	</p>

	<div class="alert alert-info" role="status">
		<strong>Development status:</strong>
		Foundation implementation in progress.
		Manufacturing workflows and AI capabilities
		are not yet available.
	</div>

	<h2>Planned capabilities</h2>

	<ul>
		<li>Manufacturing domain and production execution</li>
		<li>Natural-language manufacturing data queries</li>
		<li>Constraint-based production rescheduling</li>
		<li>Explainable and auditable recommendations</li>
	</ul>

	<p>
		This application is currently a development
		and research prototype, not a production MES.
	</p>
</div>
